{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Baseball&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Mahjong&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Pachinko&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Training&quot;!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game where you can win baseball games just by playing mahjong?!<br>Become the manager of a high school baseball team in another world! Manage and train your team, play mahjong and pachinko, and aim to win the national high school baseball championship!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Win with Mahjong</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/extras/\u9ebb\u96c0\u753b\u97623.jpg?t=1745396200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play mahjong while cheering your team on, and lead them to victory.<br>Your team members will support you with their special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Pray with Pachinko</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/extras/20250412214528_1.jpg?t=1745396200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the opponent's pitches and spin the reels to extend your mahjong time.<br>Team members\u2019 special abilities come into play here too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize Your Team and Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/extras/20241226104725_1.jpg?t=1745396200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/extras/20241226104909_1.jpg?t=1745396200\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your team's location, name, flag, cap, and uniforms.<br>You can also customize each player's name and face\u2014even how they wear their cap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Choose Your Opponents and Climb the Tournament</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have some control over who you'll face in the tournament.<br>You can breeze through by picking weaker schools, or choose strong rivals and make unforgettable memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Free to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a completely free game.<br>There are no ads or microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Guidelines for Posting Videos and Images</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unless the following prohibited activities are involved, anyone\u2014individuals, companies, or organizations\u2014can post or stream videos and images without prior notice, regardless of monetization or platform.<br>These guidelines may be updated from time to time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not slander others, engage in political, religious, or anti-social activities, or spread false information.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3423380?t=1745396200","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745396200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/6c8f49785410a5dfc4004852bb0bb012e134f825/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745396200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/6c8f49785410a5dfc4004852bb0bb012e134f825/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745396200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Baseball&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Mahjong&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Pachinko&quot; \u00d7 &quot;Training&quot;!</s