 some control over who you'll face in the tournament.<br>You can breeze through by picking weaker schools, or choose strong rivals and make unforgettable memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Free to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a completely free game.<br>There are no ads or microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Guidelines for Posting Videos and Images</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unless the following prohibited activities are involved, anyone\u2014individuals, companies, or organizations\u2014can post or stream videos and images without prior notice, regardless of monetization or platform.<br>These guidelines may be updated from time to time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not slander others, engage in political, religious, or anti-social activities, or spread false information.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Nineteen woods"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423380/header.jpg?t=1745396200","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257084814,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084814/movie480.mp4?t=1735992075","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257084814/movie_max.mp4?t=1735992075"},"name":"first trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257084814/d0ec3a372ba682f2147b85ec4847d3f37575c8e8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1735992075","webm":{"480":"http: